  "title": "Grilled Chicken Alfredo Flatbread Pizzas",
  "description": "Frozen bread dough forms the base for these flatbread pizzas covered in Alfredo sauce, chicken, and mushrooms and grilled in a Panasonic CIO.",
  "authors": [
